"Aulia Velra is the S-rank matriarch and head of the Velra family."
"She ran for President of the Anesidoran High Council a few years ago and lost badly."
"Her public email address answers with an autoreply."
"Her son is Corin Velra; Aimi, Keiko, Hazel and Lute are among her descendants."
"Hazel Velra is her favorite descendant."
"She cast the Gloss on her family; only she can complete that luck wordchain."
"She has a Healer who does full rejuvenation, and her family basically is his list."
"She holds that people brought into the family's orbit by powerful chains are cosmically ordained."
"She disliked Keiko's plan and sent Lute to watch Alden Thorn so he would not run."
"She sent Alden an uncomfortably warm letter welcoming him to Anesidora as a neighbor."
"After the Gloss she lost the Unified Rares and Uniques council seat she held for decades."
"Lawsuits followed the Gloss, and old Velra scandals resurfaced."
"Lute calls her the Grandwitch; she emails Alden offers and invitations he declines."
"As far as anyone knows, she had used the Gloss only twice before."
"She keeps her family in line with contract tattoos and has earned more than one S skill."
"Her megayacht Libra was once Lute's home."
"She is Lute's grandmother through her non-Avowed daughter Jessica, and Hazel's egg donor."
"She took young Hazel to Artona I, but punished her for a year over whiff jokes about Lute."
"Blue geometric tattoos cover her left torso, one for each Velra bound by the family tattoo."
"She locked the S-rank Healer Horatio into a rejuvenation contract when both were about thirty."
"She pays teenagers millions a year to hold Chainer class assignments."
"Lute thinks she aims to make the Velras the only Chainer clan in the universe."
"She calls Lute my dove, and paid him to take Chainer."
"Her Gloss must be paid in full and cannot be reduced or repaid by others."
"She partnered with Manon for almost fifteen years, promising time with Horatio as payment."
"At Benjamin's 70th party she publicly outed Hazel's skill and sided with Alden."
"She says Alden may very well be an extraordinary friend to the family one day."
"She covered up Hazel killing Manon by sending Hazel to volunteer on the Triplanets."
"She is no longer on the High Council."
"During the Matadero attack she translated Artonan for the fighters at the cube."
"She lent a Velra helicopter and pilot to the rescue, and chained everyone at Matadero."
"She came to Anesidora on the ship that brought the first generation of Avowed."
"SAL counts her an enemy for backing policies that bring unregistereds to Anesidora."
"On livestream she confessed the Submerger was hers, kept in a Picklock vault on Libra."
"She knocked out Orpheus without touching him and handed him over to the authorities."
"She blames a hidden enemy and will live at sea until that person is caught."
